{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And He overturned.</b> That the land and its inhabitants were transformed into the nature of sulfur and fire, as in ״הָפַךְ אֶת מֵימֵיהֶם לְדָם״ (Psalms 105:29) — and upon them the dew that had risen before daybreak was transformed into the nature of salt, as it says: ״גָּפְרִית וָמֶלַח שְׂרֵפָה כָל אַרְצָהּ״ (Deuteronomy 29:22), in accordance with what happens to every vapid moisture mixed with burnt particles."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:49.087980310Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}